    {
      "id": "ui-value-props",
      "name": "Value Propositions Grid (Lexington Bento Dark)",
      "allowed_presets": [
        "ui-preset--midnight"
      ],
      "prompt": "SECCIÓN VALUE PROPS (ui-value-props): Rejilla Bento Dark con TARJETAS OSCURAS (#18181b) y AVATARES FOTOGRÁFICOS CIRCULARES PERFECTOS (rounded-full). Úsala OBLIGATORIAMENTE para mostrar los pilares o razones para elegirnos.\n<section class=\"ui-value-props py-20 md:py-28 bg-[#0a0a0a] text-white overflow-hidden text-center\">\n  <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12\">\n    <h2 class=\"section-title text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white mb-14 leading-tight\">\n      ¿Por qué elegirnos? <br /><span class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-400 to-amber-500 bg-clip-text text-transparent\">Nuestra Propuesta de Valor</span>\n    </h2>\n    <div class=\"props-grid grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 md:gap-10\">\n      <div class=\"prop-card relative bg-[#18181b] rounded-[2.5rem] md:rounded-[3rem] p-8 md:p-12 border border-white/10 shadow-2xl flex flex-col items-center text-center transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:border-white/20\">\n        <div class=\"prop-icon-wrapper w-24 h-24 md:w-28 md:h-28 rounded-full overflow-hidden mb-6 border-4 border-white/20 shadow-2xl bg-[#27272a] flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\">\n          <img src=\"/imagenes_proyecto/ofertas-de-empleo-y-salarios-promedios-para-enfermeras-extranjeras-en-miami-y-tampa-florida-1.webp\" alt=\"Pilares 1\" class=\"prop-icon w-full h-full object-cover object-center rounded-full\">\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"prop-text text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-200 font-normal leading-relaxed mb-6 text-center\">\n          <strong class=\"text-white font-bold block mb-2 text-xl md:text-2xl\">Pilar o Beneficio 1</strong>\n          Descripción detallada del beneficio tangible en 2 líneas.\n        </p>\n        <a href=\"URL\" class=\"prop-link inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-orange-400 hover:text-orange-300 font-bold text-base md:text-lg transition-colors no-underline mt-auto\">\n          Saber más →\n        </a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"prop-card relative bg-[#18181b] rounded-[2.5rem] md:rounded-[3rem] p-8 md:p-12 border border-white/10 shadow-2xl flex flex-col items-center text-center transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:border-white/20\">\n        <div class=\"prop-icon-wrapper w-24 h-24 md:w-28 md:h-28 rounded-full overflow-hidden mb-6 border-4 border-white/20 shadow-2xl bg-[#27272a] flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\">\n          <img src=\"/imagenes_proyecto/ofertas-de-empleo-y-salarios-promedios-para-enfermeras-extranjeras-en-miami-y-tampa-florida-2.webp\" alt=\"Pilares 2\" class=\"prop-icon w-full h-full object-cover object-center rounded-full\">\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"prop-text text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-200 font-normal leading-relaxed mb-6 text-center\">\n          <strong class=\"text-white font-bold block mb-2 text-xl md:text-2xl\">Pilar o Beneficio 2</strong>\n          Descripción del segundo pilar con enfoque en resultados.\n        </p>\n        <a href=\"URL\" class=\"prop-link inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-orange-400 hover:text-orange-300 font-bold text-base md:text-lg transition-colors no-underline mt-auto\">\n          Saber más →\n        </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
